{"review_id": "2e41823e-610a-490e-8cdd-b44025c90260", "package": "app.avocation.avocation", "app_name": "Avocation Goal & Habit Tracker", "language": "fr", "language_name": "French", "rating": 4, "text": "This app really does the job of remindong me important habits. The only problem I had is that the common day end at 12:00 , but in vacancy days, may day start at like 1pm and end at like, 2am, so when I went to check them, the day was over and there was no way to say that past habit had been done (if you forget to check an habit, you your cant gi back and say you had actually done it) but for the rest its very nice", "author": "Un utilisateur de Google", "date": "2020-04-17T19:11:03Z", "thumbs_up": 8, "app_version": "1.2.6", "developer_reply": "Thanks for your feedback! Actually you can go back a day, with the timetravel function! If you tap the small clock at the top it will bring you back to yesterday and you can tick habits you forgot to log!"}
